Their endpoint maps label apparent/reactive energy as Wh; this integration
corrects the units to VAh/varh. TOU semantics are not inferred from tier number.

Discovery design also references user00265/itron-go-mqtt:
https://github.com/user00265/itron-go-mqtt/tree/0fd38765ddd73811b374c706937fdd7acd5d056c
The implementation is original; no Go code is included. That project uses MIT.

IEEE resource names, unit codes and metadata semantics follow the published
IEEE 2030.5-2023 schema; the schema itself is not distributed in this repository.
https://standards.ieee.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2030.5-2023_downloads.zip
